    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Chandragupta Maurya founded the Mauryan Empire with help from Kautilya (Chanakya). Under his grandson Ashoka the empire spread across much of India.\nAfter the Kalinga war Ashoka turned to peace and followed the dhamma, meaning right conduct. He put up edicts on rocks and pillars to share his messages.\nThe Ashoka Pillar's lion capital is our national emblem."
    }
